{"version":1,"content":"<p>調查宏福苑大火成因的獨立委員會報告今日（29日）對外公布，特首李家超和相關官員今午於政府總部舉行記者會，李家超率領官員鞠躬致歉。</p><p>李家超隨後公布，房屋局長何永賢昨日（28日）已請辭，將由副財政司長黃偉綸兼任署理房屋局長的職務。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T10:42:10.029964+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T10:22:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T23:58:11.284848+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T10:38:19.168578+00:00","content_hash":"e442da72a8246bb471f1a81c987a2525ecac6dc4f61c41aa5b42c03af9ace0f3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}